      "subject": "לאפו",
      "rationale": "Kĩhibirania kĩugaga 'icũrũ ciake' (mũgambo wa mũthia) kuuma handũ ha 'gĩthingu kĩake'; mũhiano ũyũ ndũrangĩrĩtwo na mũhiananio wa Kĩkũyũ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "יפלס",
      "rationale": "Kiugo gĩa ũgima: 'kũgũa njĩra ĩtheru' (YLT 'pondereth') kana 'kũgaranĩra'; ngerekano ici igĩte ta YPS na BSB ĩrĩ 'cleared'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "נפשם",
      "rationale": "נפש nĩ 'kĩhũmũ\/hinya wa mĩtĩrĩmbi' — ti 'moyo' wa mũgambo wa Kĩthwahĩri o wothe."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Nĩagaranĩire njĩra ya gĩthingu kĩake; ndaarĩkirie moyo wao kuuma kũrĩ, no nĩagĩtĩrĩra mĩtĩrĩmbi yao kwa mũrimũ mũnene.",
